{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4923fbd5-4752-8824-a8bb-df1be51e523a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T12:12:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about the road in front of my house. There's a pothole, a big one, and I hit it this morning and now, honestly, it's the third time this winter I've had to swerve around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "94 Narragansett Avenue. In the Fifth Ward, right near the corner where the crosswalk is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 94 Narragansett. Is the pothole right in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the lane, right before the crosswalk. And that's another thing, the paint on that crosswalk is so faded you can barely see it. Cars don't stop. They just go right through, I've watched them. Hang on, sweetie, I'm on the phone, go ask your, no, go, I'll be, sorry. Sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, you're all set. So the crosswalk paint is worn down and the pothole is just ahead of it. I'll note both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, both. And it's not just me, my neighbor hit it too. Two doors down. He said it jolted him so bad he thought he blew a tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Did he end up with any damage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:10:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that he said. For me, ever since, my wipers are squeaking so loudly, I don't know if that's from the pothole or just the cold, but it's driving me nuts. I'm not saying the city did that, I'm just saying, it's one more thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd drive me crazy too. If you ever want to file a damage claim, that's a separate process, and I can point you toward it, but for now let's get the road on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. I'd like Narragansett Avenue added to the repair list. I called about a different spot last year and nothing happened, so I'd like it actually on the list this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:11:22-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm entering it now as a pothole request at 94 Narragansett Avenue, with a note on the crosswalk markings and that a neighbor reported hitting it as well. Crews are going to be working through a backlog after the freeze and thaw, so I'd expect it to be a matter of a couple of weeks, depending on the weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks. Okay. And the crosswalk, is that the same crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:11:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The striping is handled separately, and that usually waits for warmer weather since the paint won't hold in the cold. But I'm flagging it so it's on the spring list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring. Great. Well, as long as it's written down somewhere. Mikey, put that, no, down, put it down. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to take a callback number in case someone needs to confirm the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0187. You're in the system, Ms. Wilcox. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. Hopefully somebody fixes it before the next one of us loses a tire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:12:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Thanks for calling, and enjoy the rest of your Friday."
    }
  ],
